# Ye and Ghassemi (2018), specimen SW-S3 -- LENGTH CORRECTION, 2026-08-16.
#
# Table 1 gives SW-S3 as L = 123.40 mm, D = 50.53 mm, fracture angle 29 deg.
# sw3_mesh_size5.jou builds it at L = 124.40 mm -- 1.00 mm, 0.8 % too long. The
# angle (29.000 deg) and the centring are correct in both, and Table 2's own
# theta recovery,
#
#     tan(theta) = (sigma'_n - sigma_3 + P_p) / tau        [eq (3) / eq (4)]
#
# returns 29.03 deg, so only the length is wrong.
#
# WHAT IT AFFECTS, AND WHAT IT DOES NOT
#   - axial stiffness of the core: 0.8 %. That is the whole effect.
#   - the fracture ellipse area is pi D^2 / (4 sin theta) -- independent of L.
#   - the flow geometry factor W/L is NOT taken from the mesh: the deck sets
#     paper_flow_width_over_length_sw_s3 from Table 2 by inverting eq (10), so
#     the hydraulic measurement does not inherit this error either.
# It is therefore the smallest of the 2026-08-16 audit findings, and the only one
# that could not be applied: rebuilding needs Cubit, which is not installed here.
#
# HOW TO APPLY
#   1. run this journal in Cubit/Coreform, export sw3_mesh_L123p4_size5.e
#   2. point the deck's mesh_file at it
#   3. re-run scripts/check_source_nodes.py --deck <deck>.i  -- MANDATORY. The
#      injection/production coordinates are pinned with use_closest_node, which
#      never errors: if the requested point misses the fracture plane it silently
#      snaps to a BULK node and the run drives the matrix instead of the joint.
#      Shortening the specimen moves every node on the plane.
#
# Geometry, all else as sw3_mesh_size5.jou:
#   height = 0.12340   (was 0.12440)
#   radius = 0.025265
#   z_mid  = height/2 = 0.06170
#   z_hi   = z_mid + r*cot(29 deg) = 0.06170 + 0.0455796347 = 0.1072796347
#   z_lo   = z_mid - r*cot(29 deg) = 0.06170 - 0.0455796347 = 0.0161203653
#   (cot(29 deg) = 1.80404776; r*cot = 0.025265 * 1.80404776 = 0.0455792669)
#
reset
create Cylinder height 0.1234 radius 0.025265
move Volume 1  z 0.0617 include_merged
create vertex location 0.025265 0.025265 0.1072792669
create vertex location 0.025265 -0.025265 0.1072792669
create vertex location -0.025265 -0.025265 0.0161207331
webcut volume 1 with plane vertex 3 vertex 4 vertex 5
delete vertex 3 4 5
webcut volume all with plane xplane imprint merge
webcut volume all with plane yplane imprint merge
imprint all
merge all

vol all size auto factor 5
volume all scheme polyhedron
mesh volume all

block 1 add volume 2 4 8 6
block 1 name "top_block"

block 2 add volume 1 3 5 7
block 2 name "bottom_block"

nodeset 1 add surface 36 56 63 42
nodeset 1 name "top_nodeset"
nodeset 2 add surface 28 30 50 48
nodeset 2 name "bottom_nodeset"
nodeset 3 add surface 33 43 61 51 25 35 57 47
nodeset 3 name "sides_nodeset"
nodeset 4 add surface 26 46 53 32
nodeset 4 name "fracture_interface"
nodeset 5 add vertex 27 34 41 48
nodeset 5 name "no_disp_x"
nodeset 6 add vertex 10 11 18 19
nodeset 6 name "no_disp_y"

export mesh "sw3_mesh_L123p4_size5.e" overwrite
